OK, here are some dragon scale mail hints, combined from several hints I've
seen:

HINT #1:

1)  This is more intuitive to wizards, because they frequently use this
    particular type of magic to get useful items.


If this hint is not enough and you still want a further hint, then
continue on to...

HINT #2:

2)  You need a corpse of the particular type of mail you want.


If you STILL don't get it and you want a really blatant hint, then
mark this note as unread ("M") and think about it.  If you still
haven't figured it out, then come back and go on to the blatant...

HINT #3:

3)  There is a specific modification in the probabilities of the game
    that allows you to get what you are hoping for.


Send me mail if you want the spoiler.

